{% if page.handle == 'delivery-pickup' %}
<section class="ets-delivery-page">
  <div class="ets-delivery-hero">
    <div class="ets-delivery-hero__copy">
      <p>DELIVERY & COLLECTION · ETS MADDINGTON</p>
      <h1>Handled with the product in mind.</h1>
      <span>From smaller parcel items to fragile bathroomware and tile orders, the available delivery method depends on what you’re buying and where it’s going.</span>
      <div class="ets-delivery-hero__actions"><a href="{{ pages['book-appointment'].url | default: '/pages/contact' }}">Book a pickup time</a><a href="tel:+61450960543">0450 960 543</a></div>
    </div>
    
  </div>

  <div class="ets-delivery-options">
    <article><span>01</span><h2>Collect from Maddington</h2><p>Choose local pickup at checkout and collect from 17A Olga Road, Maddington WA 6109. Pickup is by appointment only (Monday to Saturday, 4:30 pm to 9 pm): wait until we tell you your order is ready, then book a pickup time.</p></article>
    <article><span>02</span><h2>Australia-wide shipping, free over $1,000</h2><p>Tapware, shower sets, towel rails and other small boxed bathroom items ship anywhere in Australia by tracked Australia Post, from $20 depending on weight. Basins, mirrors and sinks go as tracked parcels from $25. Orders of $1,000 or more ship free. Toilets, baths, vanities, shower screens and tiles are Perth metro delivery or pickup; outside Perth, contact us for a freight quote.</p></article>
    <article><span>03</span><h2>Fragile & oversize</h2><p>Vanities, baths, shower screens and other large or fragile products can require coordinated or specialist delivery rather than a standard parcel service.</p></article>
    <article><span>04</span><h2>Tiles & project freight</h2><p>Tile and larger project orders can require bulk or pallet-style freight. Some orders may need direct coordination with ETS before the most suitable delivery arrangement can be confirmed.</p></article>
  </div>

  <div class="ets-delivery-editorial">
    
    
  </div>

  <div class="ets-delivery-process">
    <div class="ets-delivery-process__intro"><p>HOW IT WORKS</p><h2>Simple at checkout. Flexible when the order needs more care.</h2></div>
    <div class="ets-delivery-process__steps">
      <div><span>1</span><strong>Build your order</strong><p>Add the products you need and review the cart before continuing to checkout.</p></div>
      <div><span>2</span><strong>Choose pickup or delivery</strong><p>Pickup from Maddington, and any delivery options for your address, are shown at checkout.</p></div>
      <div><span>3</span><strong>Contact ETS when needed</strong><p>If an appropriate option is not shown for a bulky, fragile or project order, contact ETS before placing the order so the arrangement can be confirmed.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ets-delivery-international">
    <div><p>WHERE WE DELIVER</p><h2>Australia, plus small items overseas.</h2></div>
    <div><p>We deliver across Australia. Small items like tapware and accessories also ship to New Zealand, the United States, the United Kingdom and the UAE by tracked Australia Post, from $29. Overseas prices are in AUD, and any import duties or taxes are paid on delivery. Tiles and large items are Australia only. Delivery timeframes are estimates and depend on supplier stock, the carrier and your location. Full details are in our shipping policy.</p><a href="{{ shop.shipping_policy.url | default: '/policies/shipping-policy' }}">Read the shipping policy →</a></div>
  </div>

  <div class="ets-delivery-help">
    <div class="ets-delivery-help__copy"><p>NEED HELP BEFORE ORDERING?</p><h2>Talk through the delivery before you commit.</h2><span>For bathroomware, tiles or mixed project orders, ETS can help confirm the practical delivery or collection path before the order is placed.</span><div><a href="mailto:contactus@excellenttilingservice.com.au">Email ETS</a><a href="/pages/request-a-quote">Request a quote</a></div></div>
    
  </div>
</section>
{% else %}
<section class="ets-standard-page">
  <div class="ets-standard-page__hero">
    <p>EXCELLENT TILING SERVICES</p>
    <h1>{{ page.title }}</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="ets-standard-page__body rte">{{ page.content }}</div>
  <div class="ets-standard-page__contact"><span>Need help with a product or project?</span><div><a href="/pages/contact">Contact ETS</a><a href="/pages/request-a-quote">Request a quote</a></div></div>
</section>
{% endif %}


{% schema %}{"name":"ETS standard page","tag":"section","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"ETS standard page"}]}{% endschema %}
